---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Selected Work & Case Studies | Elias Velasquez"
  description="Explore real web development case studies and live platforms by Elias Velasquez, including high-concurrency event booking systems and database integrations."
>
  <main class="page-container work-page">
    <header class="work-header">
      <h1 class="page-title">
        <span data-en="Real projects," data-es="Proyectos reales,">Real projects,</span>
        <strong data-en="proven business impact." data-es="impacto comprobado.">proven business impact.</strong>
      </h1>

      <p class="page-description" data-en="In-depth case studies of high-performance web applications and booking systems engineered for brand launch events, featuring live production demos, UI snapshots, and technical architecture." data-es="Casos de estudio detallados de aplicaciones web y sistemas de reserva desarrollados para eventos de marca, con demos en vivo, capturas de interfaz y arquitectura técnica.">
        In-depth case studies of high-performance web applications and booking systems engineered for brand launch events, featuring live production demos, UI snapshots, and technical architecture.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Deep-Dive Case Studies Stack -->
    <div class="case-studies-stack">
      <!-- Case Study 01: Original Forever -->
      <article class="case-study-dossier" aria-labelledby="project-1-title">
        <div class="dossier-header">
          <div class="dossier-title-group">
            <span class="dossier-badge" data-en="Brand Launch Platform" data-es="Plataforma de Lanzamiento">Brand Launch Platform</span>
            <h2 id="project-1-title" class="dossier-title">
              <a href="https://slotsadidasoriginals-p.netlify.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                "Original Forever" Time-Slot Reservation System
              </a>
            </h2>
          </div>

          <div class="dossier-actions">
            <a href="https://slotsadidasoriginals-p.netlify.app" class="btn-live-demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <span data-en="Launch Live Demo" data-es="Ver Demo en Vivo">Launch Live Demo</span>
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="arrow">&#8599;</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://github.com/Evf04" class="btn-source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="GitHub Profile">
              GitHub
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Snapshots Gallery Grid -->
        <div class="dossier-snapshots" aria-label="Project UI Snapshots">
          <div class="snapshot-slot main-snap">
            <div class="snapshot-frame">
              <!-- Vector preview / Drop image here: <img src="/path/to/snap1.png" alt="Original Forever Main View" /> -->
              <svg viewBox="0 0 400 225" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                <rect width="400" height="225" fill="#080f15"/>
                <rect x="20" y="20" width="360" height="185" rx="6" fill="#0d1721" stroke="#63c8df" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <text x="40" y="60" fill="#63c8df" font-family="Space Grotesk, sans-serif" font-weight="700" font-size="16" letter-spacing="1">LAUNCH EVENT PLATFORM</text>
                <text x="40" y="88" fill="#f4f6f7" font-family="Space Grotesk, sans-serif" font-weight="700" font-size="18">"Original Forever" Booking</text>
                <rect x="40" y="112" width="150" height="30" rx="4" fill="#153443" stroke="#3b7885"/>
                <text x="52" y="132" fill="#63c8df" font-family="Plus Jakarta Sans, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="800">SLOT RESERVATION</text>
                <rect x="210" y="112" width="150" height="65" rx="4" fill="#070c11" stroke="#1d2a38"/>
                <circle cx="235" cy="138" r="8" fill="#63c8df"/>
                <text x="252" y="142" fill="#f4f6f7" font-family="Plus Jakarta Sans, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="700">Zero Queue Flow</text>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="snap-caption" data-en="Overview: Time-slot reservation interface and digital entry flow" data-es="Vista general: Interfaz de reserva por turnos y flujo de ingreso digital">Overview: Time-slot reservation interface and digital entry flow</span>
          </div>

          <div class="snapshot-sub-grid">
            <div class="snapshot-slot">
              <div class="snapshot-frame">
                <!-- Drop screenshot 2 here: <img src="/path/to/snap2.png" alt="Capacity and Shift Selector" /> -->
                <div class="snap-placeholder">
                  <span class="snap-badge">02</span>
                  <span class="snap-label" data-en="Capacity & Shift Selector" data-es="Selector de Horarios y Aforo">Capacity & Shift Selector</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <span class="snap-caption" data-en="Shift & attendee capacity rules" data-es="Gestión de aforo y cupos por turno">Shift & attendee capacity rules</span>
            </div>

            <div class="snapshot-slot">
              <div class="snapshot-frame">
                <!-- Drop screenshot 3 here: <img src="/path/to/snap3.png" alt="Real-time confirmation flow" /> -->
                <div class="snap-placeholder">
                  <span class="snap-badge">03</span>
                  <span class="snap-label" data-en="Real-Time Database Sync" data-es="Sincronización en Tiempo Real">Real-Time Database Sync</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <span class="snap-caption" data-en="Instant PostgreSQL/Supabase confirmation" data-es="Confirmación instantánea en PostgreSQL/Supabase">Instant PostgreSQL/Supabase confirmation</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Case Study Detailed Narrative -->
        <div class="dossier-body">
          <div class="dossier-column">
            <h3 class="breakdown-heading" data-en="The Challenge" data-es="El Desafío">The Challenge</h3>
            <p data-en="Brand product launch events often encounter severe registration bottlenecks, leading to long physical queues and attendee frustration. The objective was to build a zero-latency reservation interface capable of enforcing strict capacity limits per hourly shift." data-es="Los eventos de lanzamiento de marca suelen enfrentar cuellos de botella en el registro, generando filas físicas y retrasos. El objetivo fue crear una interfaz de reserva de latencia cero capaz de gestionar cupos estrictos por horario.">
              Brand product launch events often encounter severe registration bottlenecks, leading to long physical queues and attendee frustration. The objective was to build a zero-latency reservation interface capable of enforcing strict capacity limits per hourly shift.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="dossier-column">
            <h3 class="breakdown-heading" data-en="Engineering Solution" data-es="Solución de Ingeniería">Engineering Solution</h3>
            <p data-en="Architected a lightweight Astro application utilizing modern JavaScript and modular SCSS for fast mobile rendering. Connected the front-end to a Supabase & PostgreSQL backend to lock time-slots in real time and deliver instant digital entry confirmations." data-es="Desarrollo de una aplicación ligera en Astro utilizando JavaScript moderno y SCSS modular para cargas instantáneas en móviles. Conexión del front-end a Supabase y PostgreSQL para bloquear cupos en tiempo real y entregar confirmaciones digitales inmediatas.">
              Architected a lightweight Astro application utilizing modern JavaScript and modular SCSS for fast mobile rendering. Connected the front-end to a Supabase & PostgreSQL backend to lock time-slots in real time and deliver instant digital entry confirmations.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="dossier-column">
            <h3 class="breakdown-heading" data-en="Business Impact & Deliverables" data-es="Impacto y Entregables">Business Impact & Deliverables</h3>
            <ul class="deliverables-list">
              <li data-en="Eliminated physical queuing bottlenecks with frictionless digital entry." data-es="Eliminación de filas físicas mediante ingreso digital fluido.">Eliminated physical queuing bottlenecks with frictionless digital entry.</li>
              <li data-en="Enforced real-time attendee capacity limits across all event shifts." data-es="Control estricto de aforo en tiempo real en todos los turnos.">Enforced real-time attendee capacity limits across all event shifts.</li>
              <li data-en="Automated database storage with PostgreSQL and Supabase." data-es="Almacenamiento y confirmación automatizada con PostgreSQL y Supabase.">Automated database storage with PostgreSQL and Supabase.</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="dossier-tech-stack">
              <span class="tech-tag">Astro</span>
              <span class="tech-tag">JavaScript</span>
              <span class="tech-tag">SCSS</span>
              <span class="tech-tag">Supabase</span>
              <span class="tech-tag">PostgreSQL</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Case Study 02: Hotel Superstar -->
      <article class="case-study-dossier" aria-labelledby="project-2-title">
        <div class="dossier-header">
          <div class="dossier-title-group">
            <span class="dossier-badge" data-en="Brand Experience Portal" data-es="Portal de Experiencia de Marca">Brand Experience Portal</span>
            <h2 id="project-2-title" class="dossier-title">
              <a href="https://experienciasuperstar-p.netlify.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                "Hotel Superstar" Experience Portal & RSVP Hub
              </a>
            </h2>
          </div>

          <div class="dossier-actions">
            <a href="https://experienciasuperstar-p.netlify.app" class="btn-live-demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <span data-en="Launch Live Demo" data-es="Ver Demo en Vivo">Launch Live Demo</span>
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="arrow">&#8599;</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://github.com/Evf04" class="btn-source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="GitHub Profile">
              GitHub
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Snapshots Gallery Grid -->
        <div class="dossier-snapshots" aria-label="Project UI Snapshots">
          <div class="snapshot-slot main-snap">
            <div class="snapshot-frame">
              <!-- Vector preview / Drop image here: <img src="/path/to/snap1.png" alt="Hotel Superstar Portal View" /> -->
              <svg viewBox="0 0 400 225" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                <rect width="400" height="225" fill="#060a0e"/>
                <rect x="20" y="20" width="360" height="185" rx="6" fill="#0e171f" stroke="#3b7885" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <text x="40" y="60" fill="#63c8df" font-family="Space Grotesk, sans-serif" font-weight="700" font-size="16" letter-spacing="1">EXPERIENCE PORTAL</text>
                <text x="40" y="88" fill="#f4f6f7" font-family="Space Grotesk, sans-serif" font-weight="700" font-size="18">"Hotel Superstar" Hub</text>
                <rect x="40" y="115" width="320" height="60" rx="4" fill="#162330"/>
                <rect x="55" y="130" width="80" height="30" rx="3" fill="#63c8df"/>
                <text x="70" y="150" fill="#050a0d" font-family="Plus Jakarta Sans, sans-serif" font-weight="800" font-size="12">RSVP</text>
                <rect x="150" y="130" width="190" height="10" rx="2" fill="#3b7885"/>
                <rect x="150" y="146" width="130" height="10" rx="2" fill="#286169"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="snap-caption" data-en="Overview: Activity scheduling, RSVP flow, and brand portal" data-es="Vista general: Itinerario de actividades, RSVP y portal de marca">Overview: Activity scheduling, RSVP flow, and brand portal</span>
          </div>

          <div class="snapshot-sub-grid">
            <div class="snapshot-slot">
              <div class="snapshot-frame">
                <!-- Drop screenshot 2 here: <img src="/path/to/snap2.png" alt="Activity Schedule Matrix" /> -->
                <div class="snap-placeholder">
                  <span class="snap-badge">02</span>
                  <span class="snap-label" data-en="Activity Schedule Matrix" data-es="Matriz de Itinerarios">Activity Schedule Matrix</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <span class="snap-caption" data-en="Dynamic schedule and session slots" data-es="Horarios dinámicos y sesiones">Dynamic schedule and session slots</span>
            </div>

            <div class="snapshot-slot">
              <div class="snapshot-frame">
                <!-- Drop screenshot 3 here: <img src="/path/to/snap3.png" alt="Attendance Confirmation" /> -->
                <div class="snap-placeholder">
                  <span class="snap-badge">03</span>
                  <span class="snap-label" data-en="Attendance Confirmation" data-es="Confirmación de Asistencia">Attendance Confirmation</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <span class="snap-caption" data-en="Unified attendee check-in confirmation" data-es="Confirmación unificada de asistencia">Unified attendee check-in confirmation</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Case Study Detailed Narrative -->
        <div class="dossier-body">
          <div class="dossier-column">
            <h3 class="breakdown-heading" data-en="The Challenge" data-es="El Desafío">The Challenge</h3>
            <p data-en="The 'Hotel Superstar' brand activation required a unified digital hub for attendees to navigate multi-room event schedules, confirm RSVP reservations, and verify session access in real time without fragmented communication channels." data-es="La activación de marca 'Hotel Superstar' requería un portal centralizado para que los asistentes consultaran cronogramas por salas, confirmaran reservas RSVP y verificaran accesos sin canales fragmentados.">
              The 'Hotel Superstar' brand activation required a unified digital hub for attendees to navigate multi-room event schedules, confirm RSVP reservations, and verify session access in real time without fragmented communication channels.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="dossier-column">
            <h3 class="breakdown-heading" data-en="Engineering Solution" data-es="Solución de Ingeniería">Engineering Solution</h3>
            <p data-en="Developed a responsive web portal connecting client-side state with Node.js and Supabase backend services. Implemented structured schedule views, interactive activity reservations, and real-time attendance validation for on-site hosts." data-es="Desarrollo de un portal web responsivo conectando estado del cliente con servicios backend en Node.js y Supabase. Implementación de cronogramas estructurados, reservas interactivas y validación de asistencia en tiempo real.">
              Developed a responsive web portal connecting client-side state with Node.js and Supabase backend services. Implemented structured schedule views, interactive activity reservations, and real-time attendance validation for on-site hosts.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="dossier-column">
            <h3 class="breakdown-heading" data-en="Business Impact & Deliverables" data-es="Impacto y Entregables">Business Impact & Deliverables</h3>
            <ul class="deliverables-list">
              <li data-en="Centralized multi-room event schedules and session itineraries." data-es="Centralización de cronogramas e itinerarios del evento.">Centralized multi-room event schedules and session itineraries.</li>
              <li data-en="Real-time RSVP confirmation and capacity tracking." data-es="Confirmación RSVP y seguimiento de aforo en tiempo real.">Real-time RSVP confirmation and capacity tracking.</li>
              <li data-en="Zero-friction responsive interface optimized for mobile attendees." data-es="Interfaz responsiva optimizada para dispositivos móviles.">Zero-friction responsive interface optimized for mobile attendees.</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="dossier-tech-stack">
              <span class="tech-tag">Astro</span>
              <span class="tech-tag">JavaScript</span>
              <span class="tech-tag">SCSS</span>
              <span class="tech-tag">Node.js</span>
              <span class="tech-tag">Supabase</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
